flowchart TD
    %% A typical Mermaid flowchart.
    Start([Bill introduced]) --> Committee[Committee review]
    Committee -->|approved| Floor{Floor vote}
    Committee -.->|tabled| Dead((Dies))
    Floor -- passes --> Other[Other chamber]
    Floor -- fails --> Dead
    Other --> President & Dead
    subgraph Exec [Executive]
        President[President signs] --> Law[Becomes law]
    end
    classDef bad fill:#fdd
    class Dead bad
